00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:47.120
<v David Kestenbaum>But here is the story from Cody and his family's perspective. Those years where life in the Treybig household felt totally ordinary, here's what Cody says was actually going on. Cody says the first time he and AJ talked about religion was back in the sixth grade. AJ had been coaching him for a few years. And this one day, AJ starts talking about that video game that Cody loved, World of Warcraft.
<v David Kestenbaum>但这是从科迪及其家人的角度讲述的故事。在特雷比格家中生活感觉完全正常的那些年里，科迪说实际情况是这样的。科迪说他和AJ第一次谈论宗教是在六年级。AJ已经教了他几年。有一天，AJ开始谈论科迪喜爱的那个电子游戏《魔兽世界》。

00:21:47.120 --> 00:22:05.630
<v Cody Treybig>We were in my garage. And that's where we had some workout equipment at the time. And he just turned so serious suddenly. He's telling me, Cody, the things in your World of Warcraft game-- these demons, these warlocks--
<v Cody Treybig>我们在车库里。那时我们在那儿有一些健身器材。他突然变得非常严肃。他告诉我说：“科迪，你在《魔兽世界》游戏里的那些东西——这些恶魔，这些术士——”

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:23.660
<v Cody Treybig>--all these things, they're real. And they're all around us all the time. And it's not good that you play that game, because when you play that game, these things, they can come into you.
<v Cody Treybig>“——所有这些，它们是真实的。而且它们一直围绕在我们身边。你玩那个游戏不好，因为当你玩那个游戏时，这些东西可以进入你的体内。”

00:22:23.660 --> 00:22:40.880
<v Cody Treybig>And those things come from hell. It's a spiritual war going on around us all the time. You just can't see it. Only some people can see it. I can see it. I just remember I-- it was truly terrifying.
<v Cody Treybig>“那些东西来自地狱。这是一场一直发生在我们周围的精神战争。你只是看不见。只有一些人能看见。我能看见。”我记得我——那真是太恐怖了。

