00:25:46.270 --> 00:26:01.710
<v Cody Treybig>And I would be like, what? And he would make it such a challenge for me to get that information out of him. He would be like, you're not ready. You're not ready.
<v Cody Treybig>就像一个分章节揭示的故事，讲述着他们周围那个对大多数人不可见的世界。如果你知道我是谁就好了，AJ会说。AJ说他能看到恶魔在房子周围聚集。但他过来时，它们会逃走，因为它们怕他。AJ说有时他们在打球时，他能在篮球场周围看到恶魔。

00:26:01.710 --> 00:26:22.440
<v David Kestenbaum>It was like a story being revealed in many chapters about this whole world around them that was invisible to most people. If you only knew who I am, AJ would say. AJ said he could see demons gathering around the house. But when he came over, they'd flee because they were afraid of him. AJ said he sometimes saw demons around the basketball court while they were playing.
