<v Cody Treybig>--as if he'd seen something. He would say like when he was talking to my mom, he could see the devil behind her smiling. And he would tell me this about other clients he had too. This other client, his dad's part of the Illuminati. And the demons are flocked at his house.
<v Cody Treybig>当他去那里时，恶魔会尖叫着逃走。他们讨厌他去那里。他告诉我，一旦那个家庭解雇了他，他看到那个他曾指导的孩子在一天之内苍老了10岁，开始变得生病和沮丧，因为魔鬼终于能够成群结队地攻击那个孩子，因为他不在身边保护他了。

00:26:44.620 --> 00:27:06.070
<v Cody Treybig>And when he went there, the demons would scream and run. And they hated it when they went there. And he told me, as soon as that family fired him, he saw the kid that he was working with age 10 years in one day and start getting sick and depressed all the time, because the demons were finally able to flock to that kid and attack him, because he wasn't there to protect him anymore.
