<v David Kestenbaum>在加利福尼亚有个波西米亚树林，光照派在那里崇拜一尊40英尺高的猫头鹰雕像。科迪问：“你觉得你爸爸为什么去加利福尼亚旅行两周？你觉得他去哪儿了？你真觉得他那儿有两周的生意吗？谁有两周的生意？那不正常。”

00:27:27.660 --> 00:27:44.070
<v Cody Treybig>There's a Bohemian Grove in California where the Illuminati worship a 40-foot statue of an owl. And Cody, why do you think your dad takes two-week trips to California? Where do you think he's going? Do you really think he has business for two weeks there? Who has business for two weeks? That's not normal.
