00:28:52.270 --> 00:29:05.560
<v David Kestenbaum>There was an urgency to the whole thing. AJ said there were signs the rapture might happen during the upcoming Olympics, which meant the Illuminati were going to be trying to implant everyone with RFID chips. There was very little time left.
