00:29:05.560 --> 00:29:13.690
<v David Kestenbaum>How do you have that going on in your head, and then you get up in the morning, eat breakfast with the family, chat about whatever they're joking about, and then go to school, and--
<v David Kestenbaum>每一秒都不正常。我会在学校走来走去。我会想，所有这些白痴，他们看不见真正发生了什么。世界末日快到了。我会花自习时间在学校走来走去，寻找AJ告诉我在圣斯蒂芬学校周围的光照派标志。我会花自习时间研究他给我看的文章，关于我爸爸的业余无线电台如何证明他是光照派的一员，以及他如何使用天线监听人们的对话。

00:29:13.690 --> 00:29:40.810
<v Cody Treybig>Every second was not normal. It was-- I would walk around school. And I would think, all these idiots, they don't see what's really going on. The world's ending so soon. I would spend my off periods walking around the school looking for the Illuminati symbols AJ told me are around St. Stephen's. I would spend my offs researching articles he showed me about how my dad's ham radio is proof that he's part of the Illuminati and that he's listening in on people's conversations using his antennas.
