<v David Kestenbaum>Was there any part of you that questioned it, that was like, that doesn't sound like that's possible?
<v David Kestenbaum>我想对我来说，当时那太可怕了，以至于我没法允许自己去质疑。我没法解释——那种感觉对我来说有多真实。就像我身处一场到处都在发生的真实战斗中。我知道一些别人不知道的东西。我是特别的。上帝选择了我。

00:29:47.170 --> 00:30:17.540
<v Cody Treybig>I think for me, at the time, it was so scary that I wouldn't allow myself to question. I can't explain like how-- the way it was real to me. It was like I'm in this real battle that's happening everywhere. I know something that nobody else knows. I'm special. And God had chosen me.
<v Cody Treybig>是的，就像你被放进了一个幻想世界。这就像——很难解释它如何塑造你，但又同时击垮你。我的意思是，但这也是你的一部分——它只是塑造了你，就像你就是那个人。而且他以一种非常真实的方式做到了——那对我来说实在太真实了。

00:30:17.540 --> 00:30:41.970
<v Cody Treybig>Yeah, it's like you're put in this fantasy world. It's like-- it's hard to explain the way it built you up but simultaneously broke you down. I mean, but it was also this part of you-- it just builds you up, like you are this person. And he did it in such a way-- it just was so real to me.
